Too bad.

295
00:17:26,560 --> 00:17:28,360
The guy in the whitecoat got him first.

296
00:17:34,560 --> 00:17:35,560
Sir?

297
00:17:36,520 --> 00:17:37,080
Hey.

298
00:17:37,320 --> 00:17:38,320
Where are you going?

299
00:17:52,640 --> 00:17:53,640
Fuck.

300
00:18:03,240 --> 00:18:04,240
Come in.

301
00:18:12,240 --> 00:18:13,240
Sir.

302
00:18:13,720 --> 00:18:15,320
I brought you this coffee specially.

303
00:18:16,040 --> 00:18:17,040
Thanks.

304
00:18:17,760 --> 00:18:18,760
I don't need it.

305
00:18:19,000 --> 00:18:20,160
And don't bring me any again.

306
00:18:25,320 --> 00:18:26,320
Anything else?

307
00:18:27,960 --> 00:18:28,960
Sir.

308
00:18:29,720 --> 00:18:31,720
I saw you at Puzzle Bar last night.

309
00:18:32,400 --> 00:18:33,440
The person with you...

310
00:18:33,880 --> 00:18:34,880
who was that?

311
00:18:35,480 --> 00:18:36,480
A friend.

312
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:38,760
We hadn't seen each other in a long time.

313
00:18:38,920 --> 00:18:40,040
We had a few drinks.

314
00:18:41,400 --> 00:18:43,080
If you like drinking,

315
00:18:44,040 --> 00:18:46,320
my friend brought back
two cases of good wine from Chile.

316
00:18:46,720 --> 00:18:47,720
How about tonight.

317
00:18:49,320 --> 00:18:50,400
I bring them to your place?

318
00:18:52,960 --> 00:18:53,960
No need.

319
00:18:54,600 --> 00:18:55,720
I don't like drinking.

320
00:18:56,680 --> 00:18:58,440
And I don't like people coming to my home.

321
00:19:01,560 --> 00:19:02,120
Sir.

322
00:19:02,400 --> 00:19:03,400
Fang...

323
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:07,000
That person

324
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:09,000
doesn't want you anymore.

325
00:19:22,320 --> 00:19:23,320
Sir.

326
00:19:24,640 --> 00:19:26,160
I can do it too.

327
00:19:27,720 --> 00:19:29,160
Instead of finding someone else,

328
00:19:29,880 --> 00:19:31,280
you might as well come to me.

329
00:19:31,760 --> 00:19:32,760
I'm clean.

330
00:19:35,520 --> 00:19:36,880
You're a bottom, right?

331
00:19:38,600 --> 00:19:39,880
We'd be perfect together.

332
00:19:42,560 --> 00:19:44,360
Your collar is buttoned so high today.

333
00:19:45,440 --> 00:19:47,680
Afraid people will see your marks?

334
00:19:49,280 --> 00:19:50,760
Anything they can do,

335
00:19:52,480 --> 00:19:53,800
I can do too.

336
00:19:59,640 --> 00:20:00,640
Do what?

337
00:20:01,800 --> 00:20:03,760
Become the relationship in your fantasy?

338
00:20:05,040 --> 00:20:06,520
Let you do whatever you want?

339
00:20:07,520 --> 00:20:09,200
Or satisfy those

340
00:20:12,160 --> 00:20:13,920
twisted needs for control?

341
00:20:18,680 --> 00:20:19,680
Justin.

342
00:20:20,280 --> 00:20:21,680
I'm your teacher.

343
00:20:22,440 --> 00:20:23,840
In this industry,

344
00:20:24,400 --> 00:20:25,960
I can destroy you.

345
00:20:26,880 --> 00:20:28,880
Don't have any ideas about me.

346
00:20:29,480 --> 00:20:30,480
Otherwise,

347
00:20:30,760 --> 00:20:33,120
I won't mind using any means against you.

348
00:20:34,280 --> 00:20:35,280
Get out.

349
00:20:44,960 --> 00:20:47,200
I clearly saw you
with someone else last night.

350
00:20:48,200 --> 00:20:49,520
Why can't it be me?

351
00:20:50,960 --> 00:20:52,080
We've arrived.

352
00:21:10,800 --> 00:21:11,800
You're not him.

353
00:21:12,200 --> 00:21:13,200
Move.

354
00:21:13,760 --> 00:21:15,960
It's all the same with the lights off.

355
00:21:17,520 --> 00:21:18,080
Move.
I'm sick.

356
00:21:19,640 --> 00:21:21,320
Only my Dr. Fang can touch me.

357
00:21:22,440 --> 00:21:23,440
You're sick.

358
00:21:24,840 --> 00:21:25,840
Damn.

359
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:27,080
What rotten luck.

360
00:21:35,760 --> 00:21:36,920
Anyone else can.

361
00:21:37,240 --> 00:21:38,320
Just not you.

362
00:21:39,440 --> 00:21:40,560
Because he said

363
00:21:42,160 --> 00:21:43,160
he

364
00:21:43,680 --> 00:21:44,960
doesn't like you.

365
00:21:49,440 --> 00:21:50,840
Cut. Transition.

366
00:21:51,200 --> 00:21:51,800
Zhun.

367
00:21:51,880 --> 00:21:52,880
Look who's here.

368
00:21:53,200 --> 00:21:54,000
Zhun.
Senior.

369
00:21:54,440 --> 00:21:55,440
I'm back again.

370
00:21:55,800 --> 00:21:56,960
You two talk for a bit.

371
00:21:59,120 --> 00:22:00,480
Wh-why are you here?

372
00:22:00,880 --> 00:22:01,959
Here to surprise me on set?

373
00:22:01,960 --> 00:22:02,960
Well.

374
00:22:03,040 --> 00:22:04,360
What set visit?

375
00:22:04,720 --> 00:22:06,360
I got dragged back for reshoots.

376
00:22:06,560 --> 00:22:07,040
Huh?

377
00:22:07,160 --> 00:22:08,160
You didn't know?

378
00:22:12,320 --> 00:22:13,760
We...

379
00:22:19,560 --> 00:22:21,160
They changed the ending.

380
00:22:21,600 --> 00:22:22,720
Our scenes together

381
00:22:22,840 --> 00:22:24,040
were all changed.

382
00:22:24,760 --> 00:22:26,000
I suspect...

383
00:22:26,720 --> 00:22:28,880
Best Actor Zhen had a hand in it.

384
00:22:29,520 --> 00:22:30,520
Don't make wild guesses.

385
00:22:35,320 --> 00:22:36,320
I saw the news.

386
00:22:36,880 --> 00:22:37,880
Are you okay?

387
00:22:43,040 --> 00:22:43,680
I'm fine.

388
00:22:44,000 --> 00:22:45,000
It can be handled.

389
00:22:47,800 --> 00:22:49,280
It's all that psycho's fault.

390
00:22:49,320 --> 00:22:50,320
Damn it.

391
00:22:51,600 --> 00:22:52,040
Hey.

392
00:22:52,280 --> 00:22:54,080
I have a scene
with him tomorrow.

393
00:22:54,600 --> 00:22:55,600
A scene together.

394
00:22:55,720 --> 00:22:56,776
The kind where I beat him up.

395
00:22:56,800 --> 00:22:57,560
When the time comes,

396
00:22:57,720 --> 00:22:59,000
I'll teach him a lesson for you.

397
00:22:59,080 --> 00:23:00,080
Really, don't.

398
00:23:00,240 --> 00:23:01,240
And Senior,

399
00:23:02,760 --> 00:23:04,080
don't go too hard.

400
00:23:05,600 --> 00:23:06,600
Hard?

401
00:23:07,160 --> 00:23:08,160
Me?

402
00:23:08,640 --> 00:23:09,360
Heavy-handed?

403
00:23:09,520 --> 00:23:10,520
Heavy-handed?

404
00:23:12,920 --> 00:23:14,800
He's not a stuntman, after all.

405
00:23:20,120 --> 00:23:21,120
Where are they?

406
00:23:25,160 --> 00:23:26,160
Laying low.

407
00:23:26,680 --> 00:23:28,480
They said the two
units will shoot separately.

408
00:23:28,800 --> 00:23:30,440
Today they're with Director Chen.

409
00:23:31,240 --> 00:23:33,000
Shooting the therapy room scene.

410
00:23:33,680 --> 00:23:34,280
Oh.

411
00:23:34,600 --> 00:23:35,600
That's good.

412
00:23:43,840 --> 00:23:44,960
This rewrite is pretty good.

413
00:23:45,360 --> 00:23:46,360
It suits my taste.

414
00:23:46,760 --> 00:23:47,760
But Director Chen,

415
00:23:48,640 --> 00:23:49,640
for the kiss scene later,

416
00:23:50,160 --> 00:23:51,160
can we fake the angle?

417
00:23:53,160 --> 00:23:54,840
You do real takes for male-male scenes,

418
00:23:55,000 --> 00:23:56,560
but fake it for male-female scenes?

419
00:23:57,160 --> 00:23:58,160
Don't mess around.

420
00:24:00,200 --> 00:24:01,400
If this gets confirmed,

421
00:24:01,640 --> 00:24:02,680
it won't do you any good.

422
00:24:03,640 --> 00:24:04,320
And

423
00:24:04,400 --> 00:24:05,400
if you want to go crazy,

424
00:24:05,520 --> 00:24:07,280
don't drag the whole crew down with you.

425
00:24:08,640 --> 00:24:09,480
The producer

426
00:24:09,600 --> 00:24:10,720
and your Qin

427
00:24:10,840 --> 00:24:13,040
nearly blew up my phone last night.

428
00:24:15,840 --> 00:24:17,680
Mr. Zhen, Director Chen.

429
00:24:17,800 --> 00:24:19,120
Long time no see.

430
00:24:21,080 --> 00:24:21,640
Xun.
Sit.

431
00:24:28,160 --> 00:24:29,400
Why are you here so early?

432
00:24:29,680 --> 00:24:30,720
Your scene is later.

433
00:24:31,200 --> 00:24:34,360
I came early to watch and learn.

434
00:24:34,760 --> 00:24:35,760
Mm.

435
00:24:37,480 --> 00:24:38,360
Later we're shooting.

436
00:24:38,361 --> 00:24:39,456
Too bad we're split into different teams,

437
00:24:39,480 --> 00:24:41,040
can't check out your costume today.

438
00:24:41,840 --> 00:24:44,040
I prepared so much for this scene,

439
00:24:44,360 --> 00:24:47,400
Hope you get to see my
best performance then.

440
00:24:53,040 --> 00:24:54,160
Mr. Zhen.

441
00:24:54,320 --> 00:24:55,320
What are you smiling at?

442
00:24:55,720 --> 00:24:56,720
Work messages.

443
00:24:57,800 --> 00:24:58,960
Work messages.

444
00:24:59,240 --> 00:25:01,600
Work messages can make you smile like that?

445
00:25:02,120 --> 00:25:03,240
Then when

446
00:25:03,400 --> 00:25:04,799
will you smile more

447
00:25:04,800 --> 00:25:06,120
at your work partner too?

448
00:25:07,160 --> 00:25:08,160
Director Chen.

449
00:25:08,960 --> 00:25:10,520
We're shooting in sequence, right?

450
00:25:10,640 --> 00:25:11,240
Right.

451
00:25:11,360 --> 00:25:12,360
Oh.

452
00:25:12,640 --> 00:25:13,680
You two talk it over.

453
00:25:13,880 --> 00:25:15,080
I'll go set up Camera A.

454
00:25:15,240 --> 00:25:16,080
Okay, Director.

455
00:25:16,120 --> 00:25:17,120
DP.

456
00:25:17,160 --> 00:25:18,040
Bring Camera A over.
Let me check the angle.

457
00:25:25,840 --> 00:25:26,760
Mr. Zhen.

458
00:25:26,840 --> 00:25:27,879
I feel like

459
00:25:27,880 --> 00:25:29,320
you've changed lately.

460
00:25:29,960 --> 00:25:30,440
Before,

461
00:25:30,441 --> 00:25:32,080
you were pretty arrogant.

462
00:25:32,160 --> 00:25:33,200
But now,

463
00:25:33,320 --> 00:25:35,240
you're kind of likable.

464
00:25:36,520 --> 00:25:38,360
You mean I've become slick?

465
00:25:40,680 --> 00:25:41,680
No.

466
00:25:42,560 --> 00:25:44,160
Every part of you

467
00:25:44,320 --> 00:25:46,560
has this about-to-blow-up vibe.

468
00:25:47,360 --> 00:25:49,320
Anyway, you broke up with your girlfriend.

469
00:25:49,400 --> 00:25:50,560
So why don't you

470
00:25:50,800 --> 00:25:52,319
come see me tonight?

471
00:25:52,320 --> 00:25:52,920
No.

472
00:25:53,280 --> 00:25:54,280
Thanks.

473
00:25:59,760 --> 00:26:01,560
Why act so pure?

474
00:26:01,840 --> 00:26:02,840
If you're not interested,

475
00:26:03,040 --> 00:26:04,320
then I'll go find Zhang Zhun.

476
00:26:32,040 --> 00:26:33,320
I've been taking the medicine.

477
00:26:35,920 --> 00:26:37,320
My sleep is much better.

478
00:26:38,760 --> 00:26:40,320
My mood is more stable too.

479
00:26:40,720 --> 00:26:41,720
Mm.

480
00:26:41,760 --> 00:26:43,400
Control the dosage yourself.

481
00:26:43,800 --> 00:26:44,880
Pair it with counseling.

482
00:26:47,240 --> 00:26:48,320
This past month,

483
00:26:48,720 --> 00:26:50,080
has he contacted you?

484
00:26:51,920 --> 00:26:52,920
No.

485
00:26:55,040 --> 00:26:56,440
After that call,

486
00:26:58,440 --> 00:26:59,560
never again.

487
00:27:00,680 --> 00:27:01,760
Then if

488
00:27:02,120 --> 00:27:03,440
he calls you,

489
00:27:03,520 --> 00:27:04,600
will you answer?

490
00:27:13,200 --> 00:27:14,200
No.

491
00:27:15,400 --> 00:27:16,760
That's why I'm in so much pain.

492
00:27:16,960 --> 00:27:17,960
Because...

493
00:27:22,720 --> 00:27:23,720
I'm sorry.

494
00:27:30,800 --> 00:27:32,280
No therapist

495
00:27:32,400 --> 00:27:33,720
wants to fall for a patient.

496
00:27:42,680 --> 00:27:44,080
I feel like I'm going crazy.

497
00:27:44,360 --> 00:27:45,999
I think he loves me too.

498
00:27:46,000 --> 00:27:47,000
Fang Chi.

499
00:27:47,960 --> 00:27:49,600
You know the consequences of this.

500
00:27:50,320 --> 00:27:51,400
As your supervisor,

501
00:27:51,640 --> 00:27:52,800
I can't turn a blind eye.

502
00:27:53,360 --> 00:27:54,520
As your friend,

503
00:27:55,000 --> 00:27:56,640
I can't watch you sink deeper.

504
00:27:58,440 --> 00:27:59,440
It's too late.

505
00:28:02,080 --> 00:28:03,240
Let's pause the therapy.

506
00:28:05,840 --> 00:28:07,000
I won't come next week.

507
00:28:08,760 --> 00:28:09,760
Fang Chi.

508
00:28:13,400 --> 00:28:14,680
Just let me be like this.

509
00:28:16,040 --> 00:28:17,520
Now, no matter what I'm doing

510
00:28:18,840 --> 00:28:19,920
or where I am,

511
00:28:21,600 --> 00:28:23,160
he's the only one in my mind.

512
00:28:59,280 --> 00:29:00,400
Dr. Fang.

513
00:29:01,760 --> 00:29:02,800
Didn't you say

514
00:29:04,640 --> 00:29:06,440
you and I were just a dream?

515
00:29:10,680 --> 00:29:12,400
Then why can't I wake up?

516
00:29:28,280 --> 00:29:29,280
Don't go.

517
00:29:30,080 --> 00:29:31,080
Don't.

518
00:30:21,440 --> 00:30:22,000
Mr. Gao.

519
00:30:22,200 --> 00:30:23,200
You're awake.

520
00:30:26,520 --> 00:30:27,520
You are...

521
00:30:28,200 --> 00:30:29,080
The property security guard.

522
00:30:29,200 --> 00:30:30,200
Xiao Zou.

523
00:30:30,480 --> 00:30:31,200
Mr. Gao.
It's me.

524
00:30:32,040 --> 00:30:32,640
Zou Yun.

525
00:30:32,880 --> 00:30:35,440
When I got off shift last night,
I saw you lying in the snow.

526
00:30:35,720 --> 00:30:36,720
I couldn't wake you up.

527
00:30:36,920 --> 00:30:38,360
And I didn't know your door code.

528
00:30:38,480 --> 00:30:40,240
So I could only
bring you to my place.

529
00:30:40,280 --> 00:30:41,280
Then

530
00:30:41,400 --> 00:30:42,520
why am I...

531
00:30:44,200 --> 00:30:45,200
Your clothes

532
00:30:45,560 --> 00:30:47,280
were filthy from you throwing up last night.

533
00:30:47,360 --> 00:30:48,360
I had no choice.

534
00:30:48,600 --> 00:30:49,776
I had to take them off for you.

535
00:30:49,800 --> 00:30:50,800
Sorry.

536
00:30:51,760 --> 00:30:53,320
Please give my clothes back.

537
00:30:54,560 --> 00:30:56,120
They were too dirty and smelly.

538
00:30:56,440 --> 00:30:57,440
So I washed them.
They're not dry yet.

539
00:30:59,760 --> 00:31:00,440
How about

540
00:31:00,560 --> 00:31:01,560
you wear mine for now?

541
00:31:01,840 --> 00:31:02,840
No.

542
00:31:03,880 --> 00:31:05,080
I only wear my own clothes.

543
00:31:05,920 --> 00:31:06,600
So

544
00:31:06,840 --> 00:31:07,920
please give them to me.

545
00:31:25,000 --> 00:31:26,000
Mr. Gao.

546
00:31:26,280 --> 00:31:27,576
There's hot porridge and flatbread.

547
00:31:27,600 --> 00:31:28,600
Eat with me.

548
00:31:28,880 --> 00:31:29,880
No, no need.

549
00:31:29,960 --> 00:31:31,280
I have things to do. I'll go.

550
00:31:32,160 --> 00:31:33,160
Look at me.

551
00:31:33,480 --> 00:31:34,480
Being rash again.

552
00:31:34,560 --> 00:31:36,080
I always forget my place.

553
00:31:37,240 --> 00:31:38,600
That's not what I meant.

554
00:31:41,000 --> 00:31:42,000
I just

555
00:31:43,520 --> 00:31:44,600
don't really like porridge.

556
00:31:45,160 --> 00:31:46,160
Last night,

557
00:31:46,280 --> 00:31:47,280
sorry for the trouble.

558
00:31:47,400 --> 00:31:48,400
Thank you.

559
00:32:16,880 --> 00:32:17,880
Handsome.

560
00:32:17,960 --> 00:32:18,960
Alone?

561
00:32:19,080 --> 00:32:20,240
Let's get to know each other.

562
00:32:22,840 --> 00:32:24,240
So cold.

563
00:32:24,560 --> 00:32:25,560
Ah?

564
00:32:28,440 --> 00:32:29,440
Get lost.

565
00:32:30,080 --> 00:32:31,760
I gave you respect, and you threw it away.

566
00:32:35,600 --> 00:32:36,760
Who are you?

567
00:32:36,960 --> 00:32:37,960
Huh?

568
00:32:43,320 --> 00:32:44,320
Get lost.

569
00:32:45,840 --> 00:32:47,600
Let's go. Mr. Gao.

570
00:32:56,600 --> 00:32:57,680
Why are you here?

571
00:32:59,200 --> 00:33:00,200
The night before last,

572
00:33:00,400 --> 00:33:02,240
I also saw you outside this bar.

573
00:33:02,680 --> 00:33:03,680
I suddenly wondered

574
00:33:03,960 --> 00:33:05,200
if you'd gotten drunk again

575
00:33:05,360 --> 00:33:06,559
and left yourself on the street.

576
00:33:06,560 --> 00:33:07,560
So I came to check.

577
00:33:07,800 --> 00:33:09,720
Then I saw someone harassing you.

578
00:33:12,920 --> 00:33:14,280
How should I thank you?

579
00:33:18,360 --> 00:33:19,360
Buy me a meal.

580
00:33:19,520 --> 00:33:20,520
I'm...

581
00:33:20,680 --> 00:33:21,680
hungry.

582
00:33:25,360 --> 00:33:25,760
Here.

583
00:33:26,000 --> 00:33:27,000
Eat something.

584
00:33:34,640 --> 00:33:35,200
What?

585
00:33:35,440 --> 00:33:36,560
Not used to roadside places?

586
00:33:36,800 --> 00:33:37,800
No.

587
00:33:38,320 --> 00:33:39,600
I just don't have much appetite.

588
00:33:41,040 --> 00:33:42,040
Hey.

589
00:33:42,680 --> 00:33:43,480
No matter how hard things get,

590
00:33:43,680 --> 00:33:44,840
as long as there's good food

591
00:33:45,080 --> 00:33:45,920
and good drinks,

592
00:33:45,960 --> 00:33:47,000
nothing is a big deal.

593
00:34:03,720 --> 00:34:04,280
Hey.

594
00:34:04,640 --> 00:34:05,640
Before,

595
00:34:05,833 --> 00:34:07,273
the one took you home...

596
00:34:08,160 --> 00:34:09,640
why isn't he here with you?

597
00:34:09,953 --> 00:34:11,353
How could he not be here with you？.

598
00:34:12,080 --> 00:34:13,080
He's my doctor.

599
00:34:15,480 --> 00:34:16,480
I've gotten better,

600
00:34:19,273 --> 00:34:20,513
so we won't see
each other again.

601
00:34:22,200 --> 00:34:23,200
I get it.

602
00:34:23,480 --> 00:34:24,480
Some people,

603
00:34:24,680 --> 00:34:25,840
once they enter your heart,

604
00:34:26,040 --> 00:34:27,040
never leave.

605
00:34:29,400 --> 00:34:30,400
Actually,

606
00:34:30,840 --> 00:34:32,360
the one trapped inside isn't someone else,

607
00:34:35,480 --> 00:34:36,560
it's yourself.

608
00:34:39,000 --> 00:34:40,120
When that person leaves,

609
00:34:40,600 --> 00:34:41,920
you end up unable to get out.

610
00:34:56,080 --> 00:34:57,080
Hello?

611
00:34:57,120 --> 00:34:58,160
Where are you?

612
00:35:00,400 --> 00:35:01,400
I...

613
00:35:02,880 --> 00:35:03,920
I'm eating with a friend.

614
00:35:04,240 --> 00:35:05,240
What do you mean?

615
00:35:05,880 --> 00:35:07,199
You knew I came back today,

616
00:35:07,200 --> 00:35:09,560
yet you're eating with a friend
in the middle of the night?

617
00:35:09,680 --> 00:35:11,360
Since when do you have friends?

618
00:35:11,880 --> 00:35:12,600
Gao Zhun.

619
00:35:12,601 --> 00:35:13,799
Stop acting with me.

620
00:35:13,800 --> 00:35:15,160
I don't agree to your proposal.

621
00:35:15,440 --> 00:35:16,320
Come back right now.
The two of us...

622
00:35:16,760 --> 00:35:17,760
Linlin.

623
00:35:18,080 --> 00:35:19,200
I've already told you.

624
00:35:19,600 --> 00:35:20,760
I've fallen for someone else.

625
00:35:21,000 --> 00:35:22,240
I can't love you anymore.

626
00:35:22,640 --> 00:35:23,920
Stop being stubborn.

627
00:35:24,040 --> 00:35:26,400
I left the compensation agreement
in the study drawer.

628
00:35:26,800 --> 00:35:27,800
Sign it.

629
00:35:28,120 --> 00:35:29,800
This is my sincerest apology to you.

630
00:35:31,680 --> 00:35:33,040
I won't be going backfor the next couple of days.

631
00:35:34,720 --> 00:35:35,320
You

632
00:35:35,520 --> 00:35:36,960
should move out soon.

633
00:35:53,960 --> 00:35:55,040
That drink is strong.

634
00:35:55,640 --> 00:35:56,680
It doesn't suit you.

635
00:35:56,960 --> 00:35:58,424
Don't worry about it, Mr. Gao.

636
00:35:59,000 --> 00:36:00,360
Why doesn't it suit me?

637
00:36:01,720 --> 00:36:03,000
I'll make it suit me.

638
00:36:17,360 --> 00:36:19,600
You're in a lot of pain,
aren't you? Mr. Gao.

639
00:36:21,480 --> 00:36:22,720
I understand that kind of pain.

640
00:36:23,960 --> 00:36:24,960
Because once,

641
00:36:26,040 --> 00:36:27,240
I also used this kind of pain

642
00:36:27,720 --> 00:36:29,240
to replace the pain in my heart.

643
00:36:32,440 --> 00:36:33,480
What pain do you have?

644
00:36:37,446 --> 00:36:38,646
Loving someone you can't have.

645
00:36:41,080 --> 00:36:42,080
Just

646
00:36:44,080 --> 00:36:45,080
the impossible kind.

647
00:36:47,040 --> 00:36:48,200
So I'm always alone.

648
00:37:08,240 --> 00:37:09,240
He and I

649
00:37:12,360 --> 00:37:13,360
aren't right for each other.

650
00:37:15,520 --> 00:37:16,520
So.

651
00:37:17,560 --> 00:37:19,000
I also love someone I can't have.

652
00:37:23,480 --> 00:37:24,480
Come on.

653
00:37:26,646 --> 00:37:28,459
Don't overthink it. Eat more.

654
00:37:30,520 --> 00:37:31,520
Come on.

655
00:37:31,600 --> 00:37:32,640
It's fine.

656
00:37:34,680 --> 00:37:35,680
Come on.

657
00:37:36,640 --> 00:37:37,640
Cheers to the past.

658
00:37:49,080 --> 00:37:50,080
Slow down.

659
00:37:54,200 --> 00:37:55,320
This isn't my home.

660
00:37:55,920 --> 00:37:57,240
And it isn't Dr. Fang's home.

661
00:37:57,680 --> 00:38:00,159
I'm not staying.

662
00:38:00,160 --> 00:38:01,360
This is my home.

663
00:38:01,400 --> 00:38:02,600
You've been here before.

664
00:38:03,560 --> 00:38:04,560
It's okay.

665
00:38:05,720 --> 00:38:07,640
You take the bed.

666
00:38:07,760 --> 00:38:09,000
I'll sleep on the sofa.

667
00:38:09,240 --> 00:38:10,440
That's settled.

668
00:38:12,680 --> 00:38:13,880
Dr. Fang.

669
00:38:15,320 --> 00:38:18,080
I need some water. Dr. Fang.

670
00:38:57,920 --> 00:38:58,720
Mr. Gao.
Mm.

671
00:38:59,560 --> 00:39:00,920
Drink some water before you sleep.

672
00:39:02,680 --> 00:39:04,560
Come on. Take it slowly.

673
00:39:21,680 --> 00:39:23,480
Why did it take you
so long to answer my call?

674
00:39:23,880 --> 00:39:25,440
And why did you open the door so slowly?

675
00:39:28,000 --> 00:39:29,000
I was napping.

676
00:39:29,280 --> 00:39:30,280
What is it?

677
00:39:30,680 --> 00:39:32,200
I want to stay with you for a while.

678
00:39:32,560 --> 00:39:33,560
Stop messing around.

679
00:39:34,160 --> 00:39:35,640
I've made my stance very clear.

680
00:39:37,600 --> 00:39:39,016
We shouldn't see each other anymore.

681
00:39:39,040 --> 00:39:40,120
Take good care of Gao Zhun.

682
00:39:40,360 --> 00:39:41,440
Take care of him?

683
00:39:42,000 --> 00:39:45,320
Who knows what shady people
he's fooling around with out there?

684
00:39:45,560 --> 00:39:46,560
Impossible.

685
00:39:47,240 --> 00:39:48,479
I've been back for a week.

686
00:39:48,480 --> 00:39:49,600
He hasn't been home at all.

687
00:39:49,840 --> 00:39:51,040
He won't even answer my calls.

688
00:39:51,120 --> 00:39:53,000
If that's not someone
else outside, what is it?

689
00:39:59,480 --> 00:40:02,279
Sorry, the number you
dialed is unavailable.

690
00:40:02,280 --> 00:40:03,760
Please try again later.

691
00:40:10,280 --> 00:40:11,000
Well?

692
00:40:11,240 --> 00:40:12,240
I wasn't lying, was I?

693
00:40:12,600 --> 00:40:13,679
Enough, Fang Chi.

694
00:40:13,680 --> 00:40:14,920
Let's stop worrying about him.

695
00:40:15,200 --> 00:40:16,200
We...

696
00:40:17,600 --> 00:40:18,680
Where are you going?

697
00:40:24,960 --> 00:40:26,280
Where would you go?

698
00:40:28,080 --> 00:40:29,840
Where could you even go?

699
00:40:50,680 --> 00:40:52,199
Let's make hot pot tonight.

700
00:40:52,200 --> 00:40:53,200
You know what?

701
00:40:53,320 --> 00:40:56,720
With you here, my place feels more alive
than when I was alone.

702
00:40:59,960 --> 00:41:01,200
Is it really okay

703
00:41:01,520 --> 00:41:03,080
for me to stay at your place like this?

704
00:41:03,160 --> 00:41:04,160
What's not okay about it?

705
00:41:04,360 --> 00:41:05,680
You can stay as long as you want.

706
00:41:06,480 --> 00:41:07,640
I'm sleeping on the sofa now,

707
00:41:07,720 --> 00:41:08,720
and I'm used to it.

708
00:41:10,280 --> 00:41:12,800
I didn't expect to sleep so
peacefully at your place.

709
00:41:45,080 --> 00:41:46,840
This is my favorite song.

710
00:41:47,680 --> 00:41:48,680
It's Cantonese.

711
00:41:48,880 --> 00:41:50,120
I don't understand the lyrics.

712
00:45:35,400 --> 00:45:37,120
Mr. Gao hasn't come for days.

713
00:45:37,320 --> 00:45:38,560
I can't reach him either.

714
00:45:41,200 --> 00:45:42,320
Dr. Fang.

715
00:45:43,640 --> 00:45:44,280
What?

716
00:45:44,600 --> 00:45:45,600
Here to see Sir. Gao?

717
00:45:46,800 --> 00:45:48,040
I slept with him.

718
00:45:52,880 --> 00:45:53,920
I'm warning you.

719
00:45:54,840 --> 00:45:56,320
Some things can't be said carelessly.

720
00:45:57,760 --> 00:45:58,760
What?

721
00:45:58,960 --> 00:46:00,040
You don't want him anymore,

722
00:46:00,480 --> 00:46:01,960
but he can't sleep with someone else?

723
00:46:04,040 --> 00:46:05,040
Let me tell you.

724
00:46:05,800 --> 00:46:07,200
He didn't just sleep with me.

725
00:46:07,920 --> 00:46:09,120
He slept with many others too.
